      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "StormRel Let me preface by saying that this behavior is inconsistent between logins. Some days I get expected behavior, other days I don't. Some days I get expected behavior for a few hours then the problematic behavior begins. This behavior tracks between use on different devices, accounts, and networking setups.\n\nExpected:\n\nUser 1 - Be on red status\n\nUser 1 - Request invite from User 2\n\nUser 2 - Receive request from User 1\n\nUser 2 - Accept request from User 1\n\nUser 1 - Receive return invite from User 2\n\n*User 1 stayed on red status the whole time*\n\nDuring problematic behavior:\n\nUser 1 - Be on red status\n\nUser 1 - Request invite from User 2\n\n*User 2 never receives any request notification*\n\nWorkaround:\n\nUser 1 - Switch from red to orange status\n\nUser 1 - Request invite from User 2\n\nUser 2 - Receive request from User 1\n\nUser 2 - Accept request from User 1\n\nUser 1 - Receive return invite from User 2\n\n*User 1 can switch back to red status once return invite has been received*\n\nProblem with workaround:\n\nUser 1 - Switch from red to orange status\n\nUser 1 - Request invite from User 2\n\nUser 2 - Receive request from User 1\n\n*Before User 2 accepts User 1 switches back to red status*\n\nUser 2 - Accept request from User 1\n\n*User 1 never receives return invite from User 2*\n\nSomething about red status is canceling/disallowing the notifications/invites/requests to actually get sent through. I haven't been able to figure out how to forcibly reproduce because it's login roulette on whether it happens. I've been encountering this issue for quite a while though so I'm sure I'll see it again. I'm not sure how many other people play exclusively from the red status to help diagnose this.\n\nI recorded a video detailing this behavior before I realized the upload limit was only 8mb. As of posting, tonight doesn't seem to be one where the issue is happening, but when I catch it again next I'll record the failure behavior and reply here.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
