      "value": "@{60e65f577ae9d0492b0f2a75|full_name}  @{62def38c9e0ae944b12e2bb6|full_name}\n\nWhen a user in Do Not Disturb sends an invite request, a two minute timer starts. If the other user does not reply with an invite within this two minute timer, the invite is not shown to the user in Do Not Disturb. To help us with diagnosis, do you know if this is the case you're seeing, where the other user is taking over two minutes to reply with an invite?\n\nThis timer does not apply when the invite request is declined with a message rather than accepted, which appears to be an oversight.",
