      "value": "@{65f4b1a3d0a7a0c657a7d3a8|full_name} I had to retract a lot of stuff due to character limit in the last message or I'd have detailed this point before apologies. When repeating these steps while the issue is in effect, the notifications never come through. It's by proxy immediate or however fast it takes for the request to come through as there is no request to accept. To answer question directly, within the two minute timer you've stated. Declines are not something I'm testing for as in practice it doesn't matter to me if the request is declined or ignored, but by extension of no notification being present it wouldn't be able to be declined either.\n\nMaybe of note as I hadn't stated it prior, this issue happens across both desktop and vr modes in addition to the other variables from previous post.",
